# PN1: h: names a file-private definition, legal at the top level of an
# app: an h: helper runs exactly as a u: function would, and h: works
# for variables too (PN5).
== SOURCE
h:h_alf := { _r / 2 }
h:limit := 8
h:h_alf h:limit
u:t_wice := { 2 * h:h_alf _r }
u:t_wice 10
== RESULT
4.0
10.0
